{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01248",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.51,
      "end_seconds": 4.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.92,
      "end_seconds": 10.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.08,
      "end_seconds": 20.83,
      "duration_seconds": 8.75,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, doctor, it's aching bones and muscles. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.96,
      "end_seconds": 30.46,
      "duration_seconds": 8.5,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.35,
      "end_seconds": 43.03,
      "duration_seconds": 11.68,
      "text": "Only rest, and it's not much. Severe, I'd say. And tiredness as well, since this morning. I've also had a sore tongue, since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.21,
      "end_seconds": 49.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "Have you had aching bones and muscles before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.35,
      "end_seconds": 59.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "A bit, last year. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.61,
      "end_seconds": 65.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.62,
      "end_seconds": 79.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.45,
      "end_seconds": 104.36,
      "duration_seconds": 11.91,
      "text": "okay: blood pressure 128 over 74, temperature is 36.6 degrees, height 182 centimetres. And BMI works out to 24.2, pulse 76, weight 80 kilos, respiratory rate 17."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.25,
      "end_seconds": 109.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.44,
      "end_seconds": 112.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.71,
      "end_seconds": 126.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Gentle pressure over the shin bone is tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.0,
      "end_seconds": 129.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Alright, tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.23,
      "end_seconds": 140.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "The tongue looks smooth and a little red."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.88,
      "end_seconds": 157.79,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.22,
      "end_seconds": 167.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. And what about breathlessness, poor diet or black stools?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.4,
      "end_seconds": 171.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.24,
      "end_seconds": 173.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Nothing like weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.59,
      "end_seconds": 178.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "No, none, no weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.02,
      "end_seconds": 182.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.97,
      "end_seconds": 184.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "nothing unusual, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.01,
      "end_seconds": 191.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.16,
      "end_seconds": 195.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.55,
      "end_seconds": 201.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.04,
      "end_seconds": 206.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.99,
      "end_seconds": 224.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.84,
      "end_seconds": 233.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.53,
      "end_seconds": 236.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "And And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.83,
      "end_seconds": 241.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.24,
      "end_seconds": 246.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.77,
      "end_seconds": 250.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.12,
      "end_seconds": 253.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "right, tell me about your eating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.83,
      "end_seconds": 260.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.92,
      "end_seconds": 265.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Okay, are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.25,
      "end_seconds": 269.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.29,
      "end_seconds": 282.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Any surgery in the the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.52,
      "end_seconds": 286.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Just my tonsils removed, as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.45,
      "end_seconds": 290.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.91,
      "end_seconds": 298.24,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "Omeprazole. I take it 20 milligrams, once a day for the reflux."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.97,
      "end_seconds": 301.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "and for how long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.22,
      "end_seconds": 306.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "About about a year. I'm on hydrocortisone cream, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.69,
      "end_seconds": 310.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.99,
      "end_seconds": 315.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Acid reflux, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.41,
      "end_seconds": 319.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Right, and anything else to add?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.45,
      "end_seconds": 324.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "I have eczema, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.84,
      "end_seconds": 328.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Right, and anything else to add?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.93,
      "end_seconds": 336.87,
      "duration_seconds": 6.94,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, it fits best with a vitamin deficiency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.17,
      "end_seconds": 341.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.34,
      "end_seconds": 374.51,
      "duration_seconds": 31.17,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a vitamin deficiency is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's get a vitamin B12 level, for tingling and tiredness. I'm prescribing vitamin D, 60000 units, once a week, for eight weeks. It's for possible deficiency. Some midday sunlight on the arms for fifteen minutes helps. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait. See me again after the results are back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 376.24,
      "end_seconds": 378.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "I can manage that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.4,
      "end_seconds": 383.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.9,
      "end_seconds": 387.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}